              "content": "Returns the active runtime configuration of the InfluxDB instance.\n\nIn InfluxDB v2.2+, use this endpoint to view your active runtime configuration,\nincluding flags and environment variables.\n\n#### Related guides\n\n- [View your runtime server configuration](https://docs.influxdata.com/influxdb/latest/reference/config-options/#view-your-runtime-server-configuration)\n",
